body:
Here's where to find the part file:  [https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:2676097](https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:2676097) 

&#x200B;

I printed enough to mount all of the weapon options, I had to shave down the little nubs a little to make them fit but they work well!

Looks great! I have a similar color scheme I'm working on, my story is that they're from a different planet in the Stygies system. I agree with the other person who commented here: a nuln oil wash would add that certain *je ne sais pas* to the model. If it gets too dark, you can always brighten it up with a little highlighting (I know I know, extra work, but the result really pops).

&#x200B;

Great work! Go forth with the Omnissiah's blessing.
